  "body": "Previously, a navigation would create a reserved environment once,\nand use it for all redirects. This commit changes that so\na new environment is created on a cross-origin redirect.\n\nThis also runs CSP for each redirect, which is probably more\ncorrect.\n\nPer w3c/ServiceWorker#1316\n\n\n<!--\n    This comment and the below content is programatically generated.\n    You may add a comma-separated list of anchors you'd like a\n    direct link to below (e.g. #idl-serializers, #idl-sequence):\n\n    Don't remove this comment or modify anything below this line.\n    If you don't want a preview generated for this pull request,\n    just replace the whole of this comment's content by \"no preview\"\n    and remove what's below.\n-->\n***\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/3891/browsing-the-web.html\" title=\"Last updated on Oct 3, 2018, 8:06 AM GMT (93b767e)\">/browsing-the-web.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/3891/6fbb7ff...93b767e/browsing-the-web.html\" title=\"Last updated on Oct 3, 2018, 8:06 AM GMT (93b767e)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/3891/infrastructure.html\" title=\"Last updated on Oct 3, 2018, 8:06 AM GMT (93b767e)\">/infrastructure.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/3891/6fbb7ff...93b767e/infrastructure.html\" title=\"Last updated on Oct 3, 2018, 8:06 AM GMT (93b767e)\">diff</a> )",
